## Why a new concept, not a widening, and not a rewrite

The product description states: "The calculator offers separate Halve and
Square controls. Halve divides the entered number by two; Square multiplies
the entered number by itself." Square is a separate Public interface item from
Halve, so squaring is not a variation of the `halve` concept and widening
`halve`'s means would misstate the interface. The Story step is faithful to
the described Square control, so no rewrite of the Item is warranted. Policy
therefore calls for a new concept for the new item.

